# Conventions

| Kind | Pattern |
|---|---|
| Routes | lowercase path segments |
| Components | PascalCase files |
| Tests | `*.test.ts(x)` beside source |
| SQL | `supabase/NNNN_name.sql` |
| Alias | `@/` → `src/` |

- Server-only modules start with `import "server-only"`.
- Never import `@/lib/supabase/admin` from `'use client'` files.
- Extend admin CRUD via `resources.ts` + SQL + `validate.ts` for posts/categories/services/jobs.
- Honest null/setup states when Supabase is unset — no fake success.
